{"highlightedHtml":"<pre class=\"shiki ai-infra-paper\" style=\"background-color:#F8F7F3;color:#303638\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#8D4B43\">\"\"\"Behavioral lifecycle cases using production scheduler interfaces.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#8D4B43\">Inputs are independent of the candidate's placeholder representation. Only</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#8D4B43\">scheduled work, externally returned tokens, completion and subsequent progress</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#8D4B43\">are assertions; internal counters are not scored.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#8D4B43\">\"\"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#3F6D55\">from</span><span style=\"color:#303638\"> collections </span><span style=\"color:#3F6D55\">import</span><span style=\"color:#303638\"> deque</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#3F6D55\">from</span><span style=\"color:#303638\"> vllm</span><span style=\"color:#686D67\">.</span><span style=\"color:#303638\">sampling_params </span><span style=\"color:#3F6D55\">import</span><span style=\"color:#303638\"> SamplingParams</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#3F6D55\">from</span><span style=\"color:#303638\"> vllm</span><span style=\"color:#686D67\">.</span><span style=\"color:#303638\">v1</span><span style=\"color:#686D67\">.</span><span style=\"color:#303638\">request </span><span style=\"color:#3F6D55\">import</span><span style=\"color:#303638\"> Request</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#3F6D55\">from</span><span style=\"color:#303638\"> vllm</span><span style=\"color:#686D67\">.</span><span style=\"color:#303638\">v1</span><span style=\"color:#686D67\">.</span><span style=\"color:#303638\">outputs </span><span style=\"color:#3F6D55\">import</span><span style=\"color:#303638\"> ModelRunner